    "value": "Backend & Integration\n---------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| MuleSoft | Middleware that brokers all SFCC ↔ New Store (OMS) / AP21 (Product Feed) / Omneo (CRM, Loyalty) / Narvar (Tracking); SFCC never calls the backends directly |\n| AP21 (ERP) | Product and pricing master data, composition/material attributes, HS codes, and Retail Rewards balances |\n| NewStore (OMS) | Order creation, fulfilment, dispatch, BOPIS, and the system of record for order history |\n| Omneo (CRM & loyalty) | Customer identity, loyalty and CRM system of record; bidirectional sync plus an iFrame in My Account for Communication Preferences |\n| Emarsys | Marketing and transactional email, fed downstream from Omneo |\n\nPayments & Checkout\n-------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Adyen | Domestic payment capture - card, 3DS, tokenisation (Drop-In) |\n| PayPal | Wallet payment, offered through Adyen |\n| Apple Pay / Google Pay | Wallet payments via Adyen |\n| Klarna | Buy-now-pay-later on AU and US via Adyen |\n| GiveX | Gift card and credit-note issue, validate, redeem, refund and balance check |\n| Global-e | Owns international checkout, payment, duties and tax; provides the nightly FX/pricebook feed |\n| Avalara | Tax calculation for US domestic, New Zealand and New Caledonia. |\n\nContent & Media\n---------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Contentful | Headless CMS for all editorial content and imagery |\n| Vimeo | Hosts product video *(platform choice still open)* |\n| TransPerfect | Translation pipeline for Contentful content |\n\nDiscovery & Engagement\n----------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Salesforce Einstein | Search, merchandising and product recommendations (Salesforce-native) |\n| Narvar | Estimated delivery dates, tracking, returns and order/shipping emails (domestic only) |\n| Inside Chat | Live chat / support widget, loaded via GTM post-consent |\n| Booxi | Boutique appointment history in My Account *(scope TBC)* |\n| Measmerize | Size recommendation widget and size guide on the PDP |\n\nLocation & Address\n------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Google Places | Address autocomplete and validation at checkout and in My Account |\n| Google Maps | Store locator and Find-in-Boutique mapping |\n| Google Business API | Daily feed of boutique opening hours |\n\nAnalytics, Consent & Experimentation\n------------------------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Didomi | Consent management platform; gates all third-party scripts |\n| Google Tag Manager | Tag orchestration and data-layer consumption (hosted via AddingWell) |\n| Google Analytics 4 | Web analytics, loaded through GTM |\n| AddingWell | First-party / server-side tagging server hosting the GTM container |\n| Optimizely Web | A/B testing and experimentation (US storefront only) |\n| Crazy Egg | Heatmapping and session replay |\n\nFeeds, Fulfilment & Security\n----------------------------\n\n| Integration | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Feedonomics | Product feed to downstream marketing channels |\n| Lengow | Product feed to downstream marketing channels |\n| Google reCAPTCHA | Bot protection on registration and login (consent-gated in EU & UK) |"
  }
}"}

